    «symbol Variable-Phase-PWM
      «type: X»
      «description: (PWL) Variable Phase PWM»
      «library file: |.subckt Variable-Phase-PWM m ph1 ph2 s1 s2\nB1 master 0 V=if(CarrierType==1,SawTooth(1/f,0), TriangleWave(1/f,0))\nB2 latch 0 V=V(master)<0.02\nB3 ph1-zoh 0 V=idt(0,V(ph1),V(latch))\nB4 ph2-zoh 0 V=idt(0,V(ph2),V(latch))\nB5 saw1 0 V=if(CarrierType==1,SawTooth(1/f,V(ph1-zoh))*(CarrierLimits_max-CarrierLimits_min)+CarrierLimits_min, TriangleWave(1/f,V(ph1-zoh))*(CarrierLimits_max-CarrierLimits_min)+CarrierLimits_min)\nB6 saw2 0 V=if(CarrierType==1,SawTooth(1/f,V(ph2-zoh))*(CarrierLimits_max-CarrierLimits_min)+CarrierLimits_min, TriangleWave(1/f,V(ph2-zoh))*(CarrierLimits_max-CarrierLimits_min)+CarrierLimits_min)\nB7 s1 0 V=if(V(m)>V(saw1),OutputValues_max,OutputValues_min)\nB8 s2 0 V=if(V(m)>V(saw2),OutputValues_max,OutputValues_min)\n.func SawTooth(Tper,Ph)=(time+(1-wrap1(Ph))*Tper)/Tper-trunc((time+(1-wrap1(Ph))*Tper)/Tper)\n.func TriangleWave(Tper,Ph)=2.0*fabs((time+(1-wrap1(Ph))*Tper)/Tper-round((time+(1-wrap1(Ph))*Tper)/Tper))\n.func wrap1(Ph)=mod(Ph,1)/1\n.func mod(x,y)=x-y*trunc(x/y)\n.ends Variable-Phase-PWM»
      «shorted pins: false»
      «rect (-600,-500) (600,500) 0 0 0 0xff0000 0xc8ffe6 -1 0 -1»
